<title>USA: Sofamor Danek rises on Acromed settlement.</title>
<headline>Sofamor Danek rises on Acromed settlement.</headline>
<byline>Ian Simpson</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sofamor Danek Group Inc stock rose again on Monday after news of a liability settlement involving Acromed Corp, another maker of spinal implant devices.</p>
<p>Shares in the Memphis, Tenn.-based Sofamor were up 1-1/2 to 32-5/8 by late afternoon in trading on the New York Stock Exchange. Its shares rose almost 10 percent on Friday.</p>
